  <h2>What data we collect</h2>
  <p><strong>Nothing.</strong> InsureAlgo is published by <strong>CloudAlgo Private Limited</strong> ("CloudAlgo"), and it does not collect, transmit, or store any data on external servers.</p>
  <p>All information you enter — policy details, vehicle information, documents, reminders, and settings — is stored exclusively in your device's local storage. It never leaves your device unless you explicitly use the iCloud backup feature.</p>

  <h2>iCloud backup</h2>
  <p>If you use the optional Backup and Restore feature, your policy data is uploaded to <strong>your personal iCloud account</strong> under your own Apple ID.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The backup file is stored in your private iCloud Drive storage.</li>
    <li>Neither CloudAlgo nor the app can read your iCloud data.</li>
    <li>You can delete backups at any time via the iOS Files app.</li>
    <li>Apple's privacy policy governs iCloud storage — see <a href="https://www.apple.com/legal/privacy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">apple.com/legal/privacy</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Permissions we request</h2>
  <p>InsureAlgo requests only the permissions listed below, each only when you use the relevant feature:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Notifications</strong> — to deliver the renewal reminders you configure in Settings.</li>
    <li><strong>Face ID / Touch ID</strong> — to protect your data with a biometric lock (optional).</li>
    <li><strong>Camera</strong> — to photograph insurance documents and attach them to policies.</li>
    <li><strong>Photo Library</strong> — to select existing document images from your photo library.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>None of these permissions result in data being transmitted externally. All captured content stays on your device.</p>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>InsureAlgo contains <strong>no advertising SDKs, no analytics libraries, and no third-party tracking</strong> of any kind.</p>
  <p>The app has no backend server, no user accounts, and makes no network requests — except for the optional iCloud backup described in clause 2.</p>

  <h2>Data security</h2>
  <p>Your data is stored using <strong>Hive</strong>, an encrypted on-device database. The optional biometric lock (Face ID / Touch ID) adds a further layer of protection so only you can open the app.</p>
  <p>Since no data is transmitted to any server, there is no risk of a server-side breach affecting your policy information.</p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>InsureAlgo is rated <strong>4+</strong> on the Apple App Store and is appropriate for all ages. We do not knowingly collect any personal information from anyone, including children under 13.</p>

  <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Changes will be reflected on this page with a revised date in force. Continued use of InsureAlgo after any change constitutes your acceptance of the updated policy.</p>
  <p>Because we collect no personal data, updates will typically reflect only new app features or permissions — not new data-collection practices.</p>

  <h2>Limitation of liability and disclaimer</h2>
  <p>InsureAlgo is provided <strong>"as is"</strong> and <strong>"as available"</strong> without warranties of any kind, express or implied. CloudAlgo expressly disclaims all liability for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising out of or in connection with your use of the application, including but not limited to missed policy renewals, incorrect expiry data, data loss, notification failures, or reliance on any information stored in the app.</p>
  <p>InsureAlgo is a personal organisational tool designed to help you track insurance policy dates. <strong>It is not an insurance broker, agent, or advisor.</strong> You remain solely responsible for verifying the accuracy of your policy information directly with your insurance provider, and for ensuring your policies are renewed on time.</p>
  <p>CloudAlgo's total liability to you for any claim arising from your use of InsureAlgo shall not exceed zero, as the application is offered entirely free of charge.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about this policy go to <a href="mailto:contact@cloudalgo.com">contact@cloudalgo.com</a>. We reply within two working days.</p>

